<title>USA: Illinova Corp Q1 net, revenues rise.</title>
<headline>Illinova Corp Q1 net, revenues rise.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ill. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			$  0.58		  $  0.57</p>
<p> Net			 44,000		   43,300</p>
<p> Revs		     570,200		  451,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  75,700		   75,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 earnings gain reflects $7 million decrease in operation and maintenance expenses as a result of cost reductions which were partially offset by current outage at the company's Clinton Power Station.</p>
</text>
